217
00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:55.530
It was land owned by the famous singing cowboy movie star Gene Autry.

218
00:08:55.530 --> 00:09:02.010
Gene Autry also owned the California Angels baseball team and the Los Angeles news station

219
00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:06.890
KTLA Channel 5, which was the first TV station on the West CoaSt.

220
00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:14.370
Randy also shared that the Walt Disney Company purchased the property in 1959 and established

221
00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:18.250
a movie location on a still-working horse and cattle ranch.

222
00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:19.330
There's more.

