00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:25.250
He shared that just beyond the boundary of the property to the south in Placerita Canyon State

224
00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.990
Park is the site of the very first gold discovery in California.

225
00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:38.970
In 1842, a cowhand named Francisco Lopez was sitting under an oak tree and pulled up some

226
