My favorite gag, one of my favorite gags that I ever got to do on The Office was when

1121
00:48:28.840 --> 00:48:32.320
Michael's trying to convince everybody that they don't need a new copier and all the

1122
00:48:32.320 --> 00:48:33.020
chairs are good.

1123
00:48:33.180 --> 00:48:37.220
And we had that gag, Jenna, where he comes behind the desk and just tries to prove that

1124
00:48:37.220 --> 00:48:38.160
your chair's not broken.

1125
00:48:38.160 --> 00:48:41.740
And I had them rig up this thing because the whole joke is supposed to be he sits on your

1126
00:48:41.740 --> 00:48:44.880
chair and it just sinks down below the desk.

1127
00:48:45.140 --> 00:48:52.620
And so worked really hard to have them rig this chair up that sunk so slowly that Steve

1128
