And you just, it takes you a few seconds to realize that he's just very slowly sinking

1130
00:48:59.880 --> 00:49:01.660
down behind the desk.

1131
00:49:01.660 --> 00:49:06.740
And then just, Steve just destroyed me when, not only is he down low, but he won't admit

1132
00:49:06.740 --> 00:49:06.860
it.

1133
