And then the way he has to stand up is like, hey, like it takes such effort for him to get

1134
00:49:11.300 --> 00:49:13.160
out of the very low chair.

1135
00:49:13.580 --> 00:49:16.260
So that was a real favorite gag of mine.

1136
00:49:16.980 --> 00:49:22.820
Well, every time he would get out of the chair, he would make some other different grunting

1137
00:49:22.820 --> 00:49:24.520
noise and it would do me in.

