Angela kisses Andy with a passion we haven't seen since Jim and Pam in Casino Night.

1204
00:52:19.720 --> 00:52:20.160
I know.

1205
00:52:20.340 --> 00:52:20.860
I read that.

1206
00:52:22.980 --> 00:52:25.540
We had a lot of questions about this scene, though, Angela.

1207
00:52:25.880 --> 00:52:27.720
Ooh, well, I bet I have some stories for you.

1208
00:52:28.100 --> 00:52:34.100
Dory C and Amanda C both want to know, did Ed actually have tuna in his mouth when you kissed him?

1209
00:52:34.100 --> 00:52:38.040
Yes, that was part of the joke.

1210
00:52:38.520 --> 00:52:46.720
Lee and Jean, who wrote this episode, they thought it would be very funny if Andy was eating something gross when I had to go kiss him.

1211
00:52:46.860 --> 00:52:50.780
And that's why he has that line, look, tuna, tuna fish sandwich, just like you.

1212
00:52:50.780 --> 00:52:56.820
Because they really wanted to make sure the audience knew he was eating this smelly tuna fish sandwich.

1213
00:52:57.500 --> 00:53:02.280
And I was supposed to go over and we're supposed to have this huge kiss while he has tuna fish in his mouth.

1214
00:53:02.420 --> 00:53:04.620
And then you see me get up and I wipe my mouth.

1215
00:53:04.840 --> 00:53:05.120
Yeah.

1216
00:53:05.660 --> 00:53:06.500
Ed was so sweet.

1217
