00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:03.860
Would that have been better?

1235
00:54:04.160 --> 00:54:05.220
I don't know.

1236
00:54:05.360 --> 00:54:06.860
I mean, what could it have been?

1237
00:54:07.220 --> 00:54:07.800
I don't know.

1238
00:54:08.080 --> 00:54:11.520
