1239
00:54:11.800 --> 00:54:13.620
But it could have been chopped up chicken.

1240
00:54:14.220 --> 00:54:15.360
That's still gross.

1241
00:54:15.840 --> 00:54:16.940
But it's not as stinky.

1242
00:54:17.280 --> 00:54:17.940
It's true.

1243
00:54:18.240 --> 00:54:19.780
But Ed was a true gentleman.

1244
00:54:20.040 --> 00:54:21.740
He kept his mouth closed.

1245
00:54:22.080 --> 00:54:24.920
I didn't get any tuna fish on my person.

1246
00:54:24.920 --> 00:54:30.280
And you guys, when my character stands up and says, and now I have a legal issue to attend

1247
00:54:30.280 --> 00:54:33.760
to, I actually had a big speech that got deleted.

1248
00:54:34.060 --> 00:54:34.540
Yes.

1249
00:54:35.080 --> 00:54:38.820
And I was so nervous to do it because it was one of those moments where I had a speech

1250
00:54:38.820 --> 00:54:40.800
in the bullpen with everyone looking at me.

1251
00:54:41.160 --> 00:54:46.300
This is how the script described everyone reacting to the kiss and my speech after.

1252
00:54:46.560 --> 00:54:46.800
Okay.

1253
00:54:46.800 --> 00:54:49.340
Everyone watches with disguSt.

1254
00:54:50.460 --> 00:54:51.940
Dwight's eyes go wide.

1255
00:54:52.420 --> 00:54:53.660
Angela pulls away.

