Andy continues to chew and then swallows the bite.

1257
00:54:57.280 --> 00:55:00.200
Angela wipes her mouth and hears the speech.

1258
00:55:00.720 --> 00:55:04.360
I would marry you during an earthquake in the middle of a tornado.

1259
00:55:04.620 --> 00:55:08.280
I would marry you in the front row of an Elton John concert.

1260
00:55:08.560 --> 00:55:11.020
I don't care how terrible a place it is.

1261
00:55:11.160 --> 00:55:12.760
I just want to be with you.

1262
00:55:13.300 --> 00:55:15.680
Now, I have a legal matter to clear up.

1263
00:55:15.680 --> 00:55:18.660
I'm not an Elton John fan.

1264
00:55:19.500 --> 00:55:19.900
Clearly.

1265
00:55:20.400 --> 00:55:21.200
Clearly not.

1266
00:55:22.420 --> 00:55:24.600
But yeah, so I had that speech I had to do.

1267
00:55:24.800 --> 00:55:28.140
And they gave me a few alts, you know, and I was really nervous.

1268
00:55:28.140 --> 00:55:31.520
But all that made it in was now I have a legal matter to clear up.

1269
00:55:31.640 --> 00:55:34.920
